	(text "Window comparator / wake-up. Half window = 2.5 V x (1k + Rp)/(67k + Rp) = 37 ... 603 mV with the 20k RV1 (about 7 ... 120 mV at the perfboard output)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 275 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "faadca7a-8bbe-4a1e-9606-8337414f33c2")
	)
	(text "LM393 open-collector outputs are wired together: WAKE_N (PMOD pin 10) is pulled up to 3.3 V and goes LOW when the signal leaves the window."
